WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The gold cAshIo wordmark floats in a dark starfield while blue and gold energy curls around it.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Luminous rings sweep around the letters. A small spacecraft passes beneath the signature.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.042
The blue and gold light gathers into orbit around the cAshIo wordmark.
